---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config';

const description = 'How Embedded Consultants LLC in Novi Sad handles inquiries and cookieless analytics.';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description={description} image="/og/og-privacy.png">
  <main id="main" class="page">
    <div class="wrap article-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lead">What this site collects, why, and who to write to. No cookies for advertising.</p>
      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:28px">
        <p>
          Embedded Consultants LLC is the controller for this website. Headquarters: Novi Sad, Serbia.
          Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
        </p>
        <h2>The project form</h2>
        <p>
          If you send a project brief, we receive your name, work email, company if you give one, the disciplines
          and stage, what the product should do, any extra needs, a timeline, and whether you want a written reply
          or a call. We use that only to reply, and to carry on the conversation if we work together.
        </p>
        <p>
          The form is handled by Formspree, which emails the inquiry to us. A hidden field and a short minimum-time
          check catch automated spam. We do not use reCAPTCHA, and this form sets no cookies.
        </p>
        <h2>A call request</h2>
        <p>
          If you ask for a call, the brief also includes up to three time windows, your time zone, and whether you want
          an NDA first. These are requests, not bookings. We do not connect a calendar, share one,
          or load a calendar script.
        </p>
        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use Umami Cloud (<a href="https://cloud.umami.is">cloud.umami.is</a>). The script is loaded with
          <code>defer</code> from <code>https://cloud.umami.is/script.js</code>. Umami does not set a cookie and
          is not used for advertising. It counts page views and a few events, such as a click on the call
          link or the form. It does not receive your name. There is no Google Analytics tag on this site.
        </p>
        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          Inquiry emails stay for as long as we need them to reply and to keep a record of the work.
          Email us if you want a copy, a correction, or for the inquiry to be deleted.
        </p>
        <h2>We do not sell personal information</h2>
        <p>We do not sell or rent the details you send. We do not put a person’s name on this website.</p>
        <p>Updated 18 November 2026.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
